","source_order":[59,185,0],"order":10462}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0144","name":"屈晃","evidence":["santizhu059-q-3ec4913bce9db826db60","santizhu059-q-97076d40bd0ef56ee0ae","santizhu059-q-46be65f0bbf831bf6966"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu059-q-2841677f12a5060cc031","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-274375d798484d5833dc","layer":"pei","quote":"《吴历》曰：“晃入，口谏曰：‘太子仁明，显闻四海。今三方鼎峙，实不宜摇动太子，以生众心。愿陛下少垂圣虑；老臣虽死，犹生之年。’叩头流血，辞气不挠。权不纳晃言，斥还田里。","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fb0f95fd607adcc9639a","start":3,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-3ec4913bce9db826db60","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-d8c890676807d68129bd","layer":"original","quote":"权沉吟者历年〖7〗，﹝一﹞后遂幽闭和。于是骠骑将军朱据、尚书仆射屈晃，率诸将吏泥头自缚〖8〗，连日诣阙请和〖9〗。权登白爵观见〖10〗，甚恶之","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-46be65f0bbf831bf6966","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-4d9a1f244fa09eb9eba6","layer":"original","quote":"权大怒，族诛正、象〖15〗；据、晃牵入殿，杖一百。﹝二﹞竟徙和于故鄣〖16〗。群司坐谏诛放者十数〖17〗。众咸冤之","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":162,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-97076d40bd0ef56ee0ae","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-d8c890676807d68129bd","layer":"original","quote":"敕据、晃等“无事匆匆〖12〗”。权欲废和立亮。无难督陈正、五营督陈象上书〖13〗，称引“晋献公杀申生〖14〗，立奚齐，晋国扰乱”。又据、晃固谏不止","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":149,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-9a6d73f4d1b52d8393fb","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-274375d798484d5833dc","layer":"pei","quote":"孙皓即位，诏曰：‘故仆射屈晃，志匡社稷，忠谏亡身。封晃子绪，为东阳亭侯；弟幹、恭为立义都尉。’绪后亦至尚书仆射。","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fb0f95fd607adcc9639a","start":87,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
